  "slug": "dad-cried",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/16948_dad-cried.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Dad's work is very busy. Every day before I get up, he leaves; at night, when I go to bed, he comes home. Yesterday, my birthday, I called my dad and asked him how much he could earn in an hour. He was a little unhappy. I said, \"Dad, I have twenty yuan now, and I want to buy you an hour, can you? I want to eat birthday cake with you today.\" Then Dad cried on the phone."
  ],
  "english_full": "Dad's work is very busy. Every day before I get up, he leaves; at night, when I go to bed, he comes home. Yesterday, my birthday, I called my dad and asked him how much he could earn in an hour. He was a little unhappy. I said, \"Dad, I have twenty yuan now, and I want to buy you an hour, can you? I want to eat birthday cake with you today.\" Then Dad cried on the phone.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Па́пина рабо́та очень за́нятая. Ка́ждый день ра́ньше чем я поднима́юсь, он уходит; но́чью, когда́ я ложу́сь спать, он приходи́т домо́й."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Pápina rábota óchen' zányataya. Kázhdy den' ránshe chem ya podnimayus', on ukhodít; nóch'yu, kogdá ya lozhus' spat', on prikhodít domóy."
  ],
